Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: explorer: Scale the fixed pixel sizes of the taskbar and tray to the DPI.
 The show-desktop button, the tray and clock paddings and the tray
 balloon width were fixed pixel values; scale them to the screen DPI. The
 preview bitmaps of the Taskbar and Start Menu properties only exist at
 96 DPI and sit in a slot laid out in dialog units; enlarge them by the
 DPI scale rounded down, with pixel replication.
